Setup file: {{.Path}}

In GitHub Copilot Desktop:
  1. Sign in to GitHub.
  2. Open Settings > Model providers.
  3. Open the setup file above. Add its providers manually:
     - For type "openai", choose Custom endpoint.
     - For type "anthropic", choose Anthropic.
     - Copy baseUrl and apiKey into the matching fields.
     - For Custom endpoint, choose the API format shown in wireApi.
  4. Add each model listed in the file:
     - Model ID: copy id.
     - Display name: copy name.
  5. Select an AgentZ model and start a local chat.

Use this launch command each time you open GitHub Copilot Desktop.
